gantt
    title ACoolAGENT Implementation Timeline
    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %b %e
    tickInterval 1month
    
    section Initiation
    Team Formation        :init1, 2025-04-01, 30d
    Seed Funding Secured  :init2, after init1, 45d
    Project Charter       :init3, after init1, 14d
    Stakeholder Kickoff   :milestone, after init3, 0d
    
    section Planning
    Requirements Gathering     :plan1, after init3, 21d
    Technical Architecture     :plan2, after init1, 30d
    Agency Process Mapping     :plan3, after init3, 30d
    Curriculum Framework       :plan4, after init3, 21d
    Development Plan           :plan5, after plan2, 14d
    
    section Technical Development
    Database Design            :dev1, after plan2, 21d
    API Development            :dev2, after dev1, 45d
    WhatsApp Integration       :dev3, after dev1, 30d
    Web Portal Foundation      :dev4, after dev1, 30d
    Document Management System :dev5, after dev2, 30d
    Dashboard Framework        :dev6, after dev4, 21d
    Security Implementation    :dev7, after dev1, 45d
    
    section Content Development
    Agency Process Documentation :content1, after plan3, 30d
    Onboarding Script Creation   :content2, after content1, 21d
    Dashboard Content            :content3, after content1, 14d
    ACoolACADEMY Course Materials:content4, after plan4, 45d
    Knowledge Base Development   :content5, after content1, 30d
    
    section User Experience
    UX Research                  :ux1, after plan1, 21d
    User Journey Mapping         :ux2, after ux1, 14d
    Wireframe Development        :ux3, after ux2, 21d
    UI Design System             :ux4, after ux3, 30d
    Prototype Creation           :ux5, after ux4, 21d
    Usability Testing            :ux6, after ux5, 14d
    
    section Agency Partnerships
    Initial Agency Meetings        :partner1, after init3, 30d
    Process Verification           :partner2, after partner1, 30d
    Data Integration Planning      :partner3, after partner2, 21d
    Service Level Agreements       :partner4, after partner3, 14d
    Implementation Coordination    :partner5, after partner4, ongoing
    
    section Integration & Testing
    WhatsApp Flow Testing        :test1, after dev3, 14d
    Document Verification Testing:test2, after dev5, 14d
    End-to-End Testing           :test3, after dev6, 21d
    Security Audit               :test4, after dev7, 14d
    User Acceptance Testing      :test5, after test3, 21d
    Performance Optimization     :test6, after test5, 14d
    
    section Deployment
    Environment Setup            :deploy1, after dev2, 14d
    Staging Deployment           :deploy2, after test3, 7d
    Production Preparation       :deploy3, after deploy2, 14d
    MVP Launch                   :milestone, after deploy3, 0d
    
    section Post-Launch
    First User Cohort            :post1, after deploy3, 30d
    Analytics Implementation     :post2, after deploy3, 21d
    Feedback Collection          :post3, after post1, 21d
    Iteration Planning           :post4, after post3, 14d
    Version 1.1 Release          :milestone, after post4, 0d
